 ### OpenVDB Density Grid Loading
-OpenVDB Density Grid Loading loads a heterogeneous density field from an OpenVDB file to provide spatial density queries for participating media [S2, unofficial]. It computes the AABB from the active voxel bounding box using `gridPtr->evalActiveVoxelBoundingBox()` and converts indices to world coordinates. Density at a given world position is interpolated using `openvdb::tools::GridSampler` with `openvdb::tools::BoxSampler`. The maximum density is retrieved by calling `gridPtr->evalMinMax(minValue, maxValue)` and returning `maxValue` [S2, unofficial].
